### [Negative][Authz] DELETE /api/quotes/{{NonExistentId}}?version=1 (404 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{NonExistentId}}?version=1
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 404

